{'symbol': 'LUV', 'date': '2021-10-25 10:05:00', 'title': 'SOUTHWEST AIRLINES MAKES BUSINESS TRAVEL MORE REWARDING WITH NEW RAPID REWARDS BUSINESS PROGRAM', 'text': "DALLAS, OCT. 25, 2021 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- SOUTHWEST AIRLINES CO. \xa0(NYSE: LUV) IS MAKING BUSINESS TRAVEL MORE REWARDING BY LAUNCHING RAPID REWARDS® BUSINESS, GIVING BUSINESSES THE ABILITY TO EARN RAPID REWARDS POINTS AS THEIR TRAVELERS RETURN TO THE SKY. BY JOINING RAPID REWARDS BUSINESS, COMPANIES EARN RAPID REWARDS POINTS THAT CAN BE APPLIED TOWARD TRAVEL ON THE COMPANY'S BEHALF, WHILE TRAVELERS WHO ARE RAPID REWARDS MEMBERS ALSO EARN RAPID REWARDS POINTS IN THEIR PERSONAL ACCOUNTS."}